From d627d1a91ba02b8266b1677bead2286ffe71101c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:02:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Pro subscription; unlock every feature for everyone

Web app
- Remove the five ProCard.requirePro gates (AI Both mode, Memory Globe
  "Pin a Memory", Music add-songs, Watch Together cloud upload) so the
  features open directly.
- Delete the Go Pro page (pro.html), the payment card (pro-card.js) and
  its script tags; remove the sidebar "Pro Upgrade" entry, the Pro page
  iframe, the Pro badge and its refresh script.
- Remove the admin "Pro Upgrades" page and routes/admin-pro.js, the
  /api/admin/pro mount, and the pro-payments bucket bootstrap.
- routes/pro.js is reduced to GET /api/pro/status which always answers
  Pro, so already-installed older Android builds keep working. Safe to
  delete once every installed build is updated.
- Capacitor wrapper: remove the "Go Pro" launcher shortcut.

Database objects from migrations/pro_subscription.sql are left untouched.
